  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Protection Advice, Research and Capability building (SPARC) platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Protection Advice, Research and Capability building (SPARC) platform will support the Social Protection team to provide assistance to DFAT teams to improve the quality of DFAT&apos;s Social Protection related work. It will offer external specialist advice services for DFAT posts, programs, and policy areas. SPARC will predominantly provide support through contracting qualified Social Protection expertise.</narrative>
  </description>
